## What We Are Building

Two intertwined work streams across the same session:

1. **Supabase recovery sprint v2 (Plan v2)** — after Supabase organization `navia` hit `exceed_egress_quota` (19.69 GB / 5.5 GB) in the morning, Director upgraded to Pro and we landed a 4-step sprint to prevent recurrence: chat-route error envelope (HTML never reaches Polин`s bubble again), TD-25 P4 markAwaitingDirector PA tool (replaces regex `await-detector`), event-driven watchdog (deletes every-minute cron, replaces with cancelOn-based pa-escalation-timer), NotificationDot Realtime (50-100 polls/min → 1 socket).

2. **TD-30/TD-34 follow-ups + live smoke** — landed `regenerateImageFromPlan` PA tool (closes manual plan→image gap), `listShots` PA tool with ID_RESOLUTION_DISCIPLINE prompt block (Polин`а stops asking Director for shotIds), per-shot activity titles ("Reference Designer started — SH08" vs generic), and **TD-34 STANDING_APPROVAL_SCOPE + BANNED PHRASES** prompt fix (Polин`а was dropping out of autonomy after first batch, claiming «инструменты в этом триггере запрещены»). Then ran SS-S15-E01 smoke through SH22 with Director's режиссёрский language as input, validating the whole stack on live data.

